        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-42480-42527"><seg source="#source-42480-42498">きよろりと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42498-42516"><rb>見向</rb><rt>みむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42516-42527">いて、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-42527-42723"><seg source="#source-42527-42530">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42530-42616"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-4-2-92-68" source="#source-42530-42598">饀</g><seg source="#source-42598-42601">子</seg></rb><rt>あんこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42616-42625">ならお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42625-42643"><rb>手間</rb><rt>てま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42643-42646">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42646-42658"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby>れますツ。」と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42679-42694"><rb>又</rb><rt>また</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42694-42715"><rb>仰向</rb><rt>あふむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42715-42723">く。</seg></p>
